// A list type's element type. How many parameters a function has, or
// arguments a case passes -- both a node's first child list -- is
// flat_arg_count (mid/names/limits/expr/more/report.id).

list_elem(string t) {
  int n = len(t);
  string et = slice(t, 0, n - 2);
} return string et;
("int[]"):("int")
("string[]"):("string")
